{"root":{"data":{"id":"dldte2wisxk0","created":1789264672233,"text":"血液的一般检查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtf2310f40","created":1789264748813,"text":"血常规检测概况"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtkzw0nzc0","created":1789265214221,"text":"血常规检测标本"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtl4atytc0","created":1789265223824,"text":"采血方法：静脉采血法，毛细血管采血\n采样体积：2ml/≥200ul\n紫管抗凝：常用EDTA K2（终浓度为1.5~2.2mg/ml），一般不用枸橼酸钠或肝素\n样本保存：室温下18℃~25℃，2~3h（不超过24h）\n "},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}